sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: M3 trust ratchet sequence
    accDescr: A new roster edit asks the parent-position roster who signed it, every merge parent verifies independently, and hosts accept trusted history or hold a named refusal.
    participant P as Parent roster
    participant C as New commit
    participant H as Every host
    C->>P: 1 · Ask who signed me
    P-->>C: 2 · Answer trusted at parent and class permits paths
    Note over C: 3 · Verify every merge parent independently
    alt trusted history
        H->>H: 4 · Accept; roster advances
    else unknown, removed, or class refusal
        H->>H: 5 · Hold items and alert by name
    end
